ogo.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75\"/></a><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Discover languages, learn words, and help preserve indigenous language knowledge for generations to come.</p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Explore</h4><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/languages\">Languages</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/dictionary\">Dictionary</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/search\">Search</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Korot</h4><ul class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/register\">Create an account</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/login\">Login</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"container-koro border-t border-border py-5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Korot. Built to discover, learn, and preserve language knowledge.</div></footer><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 grid grid-cols-6 border-t border-border bg-card/95 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] backdrop-blur-md md:hidden\"><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg>Home</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/languages\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg>Languages</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/dictionary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg>Dictionary</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg>Search</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/login\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>Login</a><button aria-label=\"More menu\" class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors active:bg-muted\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg>More</button></nav></div><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed bottom-0 right-0 z-[100] flex w-full max-w-sm flex-col gap-2 p-4 outline-none sm:bottom-4 sm:right-4\"></ol></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-c2c88ec01ff0ef03.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><div><section class=\"border-b border-border bg-primary-50/60\"><div class=\"container-koro flex flex-col items-center gap-4 py-16 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-extrabold sm:text-4xl\">About Korot</h1><p class=\"max-w-xl text-muted-foreground\">Korot is a home for discovering, learning, and preserving language knowledge — starting with the languages and communities that need it most.</p></div></section><section class=\"container-koro py-16\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-50 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Every language matters</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">From widely spoken languages to indigenous languages with few remaining speakers, Korot treats every language as worth discovering and preserving.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-50 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Community-powered</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Speakers and learners can suggest translations. Every contribution is reviewed before it becomes part of the official record.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-6 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary-50 text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Trust in every word</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Community submissions are always clearly labeled as pending until reviewed — never blended with verified translations.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-border bg-muted/40 py-16\"><div class=\"container-koro\"><h2 class=\"text-center text-2xl font-bold\">How it works</h2><div class=\"mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center\"><div class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-card shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700\"><span>1</span><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></span><span>Explore</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Browse languages and dictionary categories — no account needed.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center\"><div class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-card shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open-text size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M16 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M16 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path><path d=\"M6 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9h2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700\"><span>2</span><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></span><span>Learn</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">See translations, pronunciation, and examples for any word.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 text-center\"><div class=\"flex size-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-card shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bookmark-plus size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v6\"></path><path d=\"M15 10H9\"></path><path d=\"M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v15a1 1 0 0 1-1.496.868l-4.512-2.578a2 2 0 0 0-1.984 0l-4.512 2.578A1 1 0 0 1 5 20V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700\"><span>3</span><span class=\"h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-primary-700\"></span><span>Save</span></div><p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Create an account to save words and build personal books.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container-koro py-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col 